<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ OLI MOA</para>
  <para style="ip">Mmerɛ bɔ Paul hworɔle krataa he kɔyɛ afoɛ 61-64 Y.A <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> ne, né Timoteo wɔ Efeso na Paul koso né ɔwɔ Makedonia. Ye krataa ne maa Timoteo nwuni kyɛbɔ okoli asafo ne nyunu ɔ. Né sikaa wɔ Efeso kuro nanu, na ne ɛberɛ yɛ hye paa, ofikyɛ ne Efeso te nekaa bɔ hyep bagyina ɔ. (Kyire kyɛ ne ole <char style="tl">Habɔ</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo “</char><char style="it">Harbour.</char>”</note>) Paul maa Timoteo nwuni ye kyɛ, ɔtena Efeso, na ɔma bɛbɔ bahwe bɛ nwo bafi Kristo ngyerɛkyerɛ nwo ne nwu ye kyɛ, bɛngɔhora bɛngɔ hyirehyire ngyerɛkyerɛ foforɛ biala wɔ berɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul sa maa onwuni ye kyɛ, ne Nyameɛ anwu ye anwunvo paa. Ɔwɔ nu, otuli ye nye siele Kristofoɛ naso, nakoso Nyameɛ nwuni ye anwunvo, na wabu ye kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ wafa adwuma pirikua bie wawura ye sa. Afei, Paul hane kyɛ odikyɛ yɛbɔ mbaeɛ yɛma afoforɛ, bɔ awaen nu mbanyi boka so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a Nyameɛ asomvoɛ konya asomdwie.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul maa Timoteo nwuni ye kyɛ, bɔ Nyameɛ kuro yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmenia ahoroɛ mukoraati konya nahorɛ nanwo nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu. Na ɔmaa Timoteo nwuni nningyein bɔ ɔmaa ebie kora bayɛ asafo nu panyi anaa asafo nu somvoɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wɔ Paul krataa nanu ne, ohyirele nu kyɛ, ebiemɔ kɔhwe bɛ nwo kofi gyidie nanwo na bɛkɔlaka-laka afoforɛ. Sɔ mmenia hemɔ ngɔha nahorɛ, bɛkɔ bra agyaa, na bɛkɔhyɛ mmenia kyɛ betua bɛ nwo aleɛ biemɔ. Nakoso, ɔhyɛle Timoteo nguraen kyɛ, ɔfa ye suban, ye ngyerɛkyerɛ, ne ye dɔ yɛ nneasoɛ ma aliemaa nemɔ suesua.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔbaayie ne, ɔhane kyɛ, bɛbɔ bɛ kyirekyire ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ ɔne Kristo deɛ ne nnyia ne, bama bɛ nwo so. Na osa hane kyɛ, bɛbɔ bɛ nye aboro kyɛ bɛkɔyɛ asikafoɛ ne tɔ ngaen bɔ ɔyɛ suro nu, na ɔfa ɔhaw pee ba bɛ so. Na ɔmaa onwuni suban ahoroɛ bɔ odikyɛ Kristofoɛ nya ye ɔ.</para>
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔyele Timoteo kyɛ ɔhõ tia ngondombo ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ ɔkɔso wɔ Efesofoɛ asafo nanu ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-20">1:3-20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbaeɛ ne suban bɔ odikyɛ yɛda ye ali wɔ asafo nanu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 2:1-15">2:1-15</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbanyi ne asomvoɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 3:1-16">3:1-16</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ awaefoɛ keka; ɔne bɔ Timoteo kɔyɛ kɔfa kosi sɔ dwirɛ nemɔ atee (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-16">4:1-16</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Suban pa bɔ odikyɛ ebiala nya ye wɔ asafo nanu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 5:1-6:2">5:1–6:2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo bɔ ɔha hyirele Timoteo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 6:3-21">6:3-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Me Paul, bɔ y'Agyenkwa Nyameɛ ne Yesu Kristo bɔ ɔte y'anidasoɛ né aye me kyɛ nyɛ Yesu Kristo somafoɛ,<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />mefa krataa he mekɔma Timoteo bɔ ɔte mma paa wɔ gyidie nanu ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Adom, asomdwie, ne anwunvoin bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ, ne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ ha wɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Mekɔ Makedonia ne, nzrɛle wɔ kyɛ ɛtena Efeso, sɔ ala yeɛ kesaalae mesrɛ wɔ kyɛ tena berɛ, na ma ebiemɔ nwu ye kyɛ ɔnzɛ kyɛ bekyirekyire ngyerɛkyerɛ foforɛ biala, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />na nnɛmaa bɛha bɛ nwo wɔ anansesɛm<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Edwirɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ”</char></note> ne abusua sanden nwo dwirɛ nwo. Mvasoɛ biala nne sɔ nningyein nemɔ so, na bɔ ofi nu ba yeɛ ole ngẽka; na ɔmma yɛnnya nikye biala bɔ ɔkɔmaa yɛ gyidie kɔyɛ se mvi Nyameɛ berɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, akwankyerɛ he botae yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛkofi ahone bɔ enu te nu, ahonim<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Tiboa.”</char></note> pa, ɔne gyidie bɔ nyaatwom nne nu yɛkɔla ɔdɔ ali. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Ebiemɔ ahwe bɛ nwo afi sɔ nningyein hemɔ nwo, na edwirɛ bɔ mvasoɛ biala nne so yeɛ bɛkeka ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Bɛpena kyɛ bɛkyire mmeraa ne, nakoso bɔ bɛka ne po, bɛnde yebo, na bɔ basɔ nu twaan ne koso, bɛnde yebo.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Yɛse kyɛ, sɛ ebie fa mmeraa ne yɛ adwuma yé de a, mmeraa ne te pa, <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />nakoso odikyɛ onwu kyɛ, nná teneneefoɛ ti yeɛ bɛhyɛ mmeraa ɔ, mmom bɛhyɛ mmeraa bɛma mmeratofoɛ, atuatefoɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛnzuro Nyameɛ, abɔnefoɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛdi bɛ mmango mɔ hwamɔ, bɛ bɔ bɛ nwo nde, bɛ bɔ bɛku bɛ baba ne bɛ maame mɔ, awudifoɛ, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />adwamammɔfoɛ, mmrienzua bɔ bɛne mmrienzua da, bɛ bɔ bɛkye mmenia besie, bɛ bɔ bɛnga nahorɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛka ndaen a benni so, ɔne nikye biala bɔ ɔne ngyerɛkyerɛ pa ne nyia ne, <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />kyɛbɔ anuonyam nzɛmba bɔ anigye Nyameɛ ne afa ama me ne te ne.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Meda y'Awurade Yesu Kristo bɔ ɔma me anwoserɛ ne ase, ofikyɛ wanwu me kyɛ ebie bɔ odi nahorɛ, yeti yeɛ wafa ɔsom adwuma bie wawura me sa ne. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Ɔwɔ nu, mmerɛ bie bɔ wapɛ nu ne, né mekeka mmusue dwirɛ, metane mmenia nye, na ne nde patapaa. Nakoso onwuni me anwunvo, ofikyɛ ne menze bɔ meyɛ ɔ, na né nne gyidie koso. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Nakoso, y'Awurade adom ne bole me so, ɔne gyidie ne ɔdɔ bɔ ɔwɔ Yesu Kristo nu ne. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Sɔ dwirɛ he te nahorɛ, na odikyɛ yedɛ yɛ to nu; yeɛ ole: Kristo Yesu wale ewiase kyɛ ɔbaale abɔnefoɛ ngoa, ná me yeɛ nni moa wɔ sɔ abɔnefoɛ nemɔ nu ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Ye mukoraati si ne, onwuni me anwunvo kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a me bɔ nni moa wɔ abɔnefoɛ nu ne, Kristo Yesu kɔfa me so kɔye y'aboterɛ mukoraati ali, na wafa me wayɛ nneasoɛ wama bɛbɔ bekonya ye nu gyidie ne, na banya daa ngoa. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Afei, Ɔhene bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa bɔ ɔmborɔ, ná anyeɛ nnwu ye ne, Nyameɛ komapɛ twen ne, ye yeɛ nidie ne anuonyam ha ye daa, daa. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Afei, mma Timoteo, mefa akwankyerɛ he mewura wɔ sa, kyɛbɔ ngɔm bɔ bɛhyɛ bɛfale wɔ nwo ne te ne, na wamaa ahõ koɛ pa ne, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />atira gyidie ne ahonim pa nu. Ɛhe yeɛ ebiemɔ apia ato nekaa bie bɔ wamaa bafĩ ase wɔ gyidie nanu ne. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Bɛ nu bie yeɛ ole Himeneo ne Alɛzanda, na bɛ de, mafa bɛ mawura Satan sa kyɛ ɔhwe bɛ so, ná wamaa basua kyɛ bɛngɔkeka mmusue dwirɛ kõ.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Bɔ oli moa koraa ne, mesrɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔfa ngotosrɛ, mbaebɔ, ɛsrɛlɛ bɔ bɛsrɛ bɛma afoforɛ, ɔne asennaa so bɛsrɛ bɛma ebiala, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />ahemvo ne bɛ bɔ bɛle tumi mukoraati, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛkɔtena ase konn na yɛ so anu adwo yɛ, mmerɛ bɔ yɛbɔ yɛ bra wɔ nyamesom pa ne nidie nu ne. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Ɛhe yeɛ ɔsɔ Nyameɛ, y'Agyenkwa ne nye ɔ, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />ye yeɛ ɔpena kyɛ odɛ́ mmenia ahoroɛ mukoraati, maa bɛbanya nahorɛ nanwo nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu ne. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ komapɛ twen yeɛ ɔwɔ berɛ ɔ, na bɔ ogyi Nyameɛ ne mmenia afia ne koso te komapɛ, yeɛ ole Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />Ye yeɛ ɔfale ye nwo yɛle agyedeɛ mane mmenia mukoraati, na bɛkoli ɛhe nwo adanzeɛ wɔ ye bɔbɔ ye mmerɛ nu. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Sɔ adanzeɛ he ati yeɛ baye me kyɛ ebie bɔ ɔka nzɛmba ne somafoɛ bama maen-maen ne, kyɛ ngyirekyire bɛ gyidie ne nahorɛ ne. Edwirɛ bɔ meka ne te nahorɛ, memmbɛ anoanu.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Yeti, daa mepena kyɛ mmrienzua yeɛ bɛbɔ mbaeɛ wɔ nekaa biala ɔ, bɛma asaa bɔ ye nwo te so, bɔ ɛyaa ne aporowaa biala nne nu ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Sɔ ala yeɛ odikyɛ mmrasua fa anwobraseɛ ne adwene bɔ enu la berɛ wura ndadeɛ bɔ ɔfata. Nná bɔ ɛhe kyire yeɛ ole kyɛ bɛkɔbɔ bɛ ti kundaen, bɛkɔfa sikaa kɔkorɛ, agudeɛ pa, anaa ndadeɛ bɔ ye nyɔboɛ yɛ se bɛkosiesie bɛ nwo, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />mmom bɔ ohia yeɛ ole kyɛ bɛkɔyɛ nningyein pa bɔ ɔfata mmrasua bɔ bɛsõ Nyameɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Odikyɛ brasua yɛ konn, na ofi anwobraseɛ mukoraati nu sua nikye. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Brasua de, memma ye atee kyɛ ohyirehyire, anaa oli brienzua so, mmom odikyɛ ɔyɛ konn. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Ofikyɛ bɛbɔle Adam kora yeɛ bɛbɔ Hawa ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Afei koso, nná Adam yeɛ bɛlaka-lakale ye ɔ, mmom brasua ne yeɛ bɛlaka-lakale ye maa ɔtole mmeraa ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Nakoso, sɛ ɔkɔ so tena gyidie ne ɔdɔ nu, ɔyɛ krongron na ɔmaa ye adwene nu da berɛ a, ɔnate aworɛ so konya ahobammɔ.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Edwirɛ he te nahorɛ, sɛ ebie pena kyɛ ɔyɛ panyi<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔyɛ nneafoɛ”</char></note> a, ne wafa adwuma pa. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Yeti, odikyɛ ɔyɛ ebie bɔ edwirɛ nne ye nwo, sɛ wagya a, ɔye kõ, ɔnyɛ ye nikye ma ɔmmo so, ye adwene nu la berɛ, ɔyɛ ye nikye biala pɛpɛɛpɛ, odɛ́ mmenia wɔfoɛ, ɔkora kyirekyire, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />ɔtte kɔwenzaniɛ, ɔnyɛ basabasa, mmom ɔte edwirɛ bo, onguro ngondii, ye nye mmoro sikaa, <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />ɔte ebie bɔ ɔnea ye awuro so yé, ye mmaa nye la ase na bɛbrɛ bɛ nwo ase bɛma ye. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />(Sɛ ebie ngora nni ye awuro so a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ né wahora wanea Nyameɛ asafo so?) <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Ɔnzɛ kyɛ ɔyɛ ebie bɔ ɔte foforɛ wɔ gyidie nanu, ofikyɛ annea a né wama ye nwo so maa wanya Abɔnzam atemmuo ne bie. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Afei koso, odikyɛ bɛ bɔ benne asafo nanu ne bɔ ye dumaa pa,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Di ye nwo adanzeɛ pa”</char></note> na ye nyunu angua ase ma wandɔ Abɔnzam ngaen nu.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Asafo nu asomvoɛ koso, odikyɛ bɛ nye da ase, bɛka edwirɛ a, bɛ nzesa bɛ noa, bɛnno nzãa ma bɛmmo so, bɛmmu mmenia bɛmva so, <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />na bɛfa ahonim bɔ enu te bɛtira gyidie nanwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea nanu yé. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Sɛ bɛdi moa bɛsɔ bɛ bɛnea, na sɛ bɛfata, bɔ edwirɛ biala nne bɛ nwo a, ne bamaa basõ kyɛ asomvoɛ. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Sɔ ala yeɛ odikyɛ mmrasua ma bɛ nye da berɛ, bɛnzɛkye mmenia dumaa, bɛnyɛ bɛ nikye ma ɔmmo so, ná bɛdi nahorɛ wɔ nikye biala nu. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Asafo nu somvoɛ koso, odikyɛ ɔyɛ brienzua bɔ ɔye kõ, ebie bɔ ɔkora nea ye mmaa ne ye awuro so kama. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Ofikyɛ, mmrienzua bɔ bɛsõ yé ne nya dumaa pa, na bɛkora bɛfa akukuduro bɛka gyidie bɔ ɔwɔ Kristo Yesu nu nanwo dwirɛ.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Me nye la so kyɛ ɔngɔhyɛ biala ngɔwa wɔ berɛ, nakoso medi moa metworɔ ɛhe mebrɛ wɔ, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />na sɛ me kyɛ a, anwu atee bɔ ɛkɔfa so kɔbɔ wɔ bra wɔ Nyameɛ awuro, kyire kyɛ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte ase ne asafo bɔ ɔte nahorɛ ne pila, ne ye fapem nanu. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Nahorɛ nu, aporowaa biala nne ye nwo kyɛ, nyamesom nwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea ne te piri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Bɛlale ye ali wɔ anwoɔnaen nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">bɛbule ye bem honhom nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">ɔyele ye nwo ali hyirele abɔfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">bɛhane ye nwo dwirɛ bɛhyirele maen-maen ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">bɛlɛle ye bɛlili wɔ wiase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">bɛfale ye bɛhɔle anwuro wɔ anuonyam nu.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Nakoso, honhom<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Honhom nu dwirɛ</char></note> ne ka ye pefee kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ oli siɛ nanu ne, ebiemɔ kɔhwe bɛ nwo kofi gyidie nanwo, na bɛkooli honhom nu dwirɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ, ɔne sunzummɔne ngyerɛkyerɛ si. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛkotie nyaatwomfoɛ bɔ bɛnga nahorɛ, bɔ b'ahonim awu koraa ná wayɛ kyɛ kena-mvoin bɔ buralɛ ayera ebie maa waala ye berɛ ne. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Bɛbra agyaa, na bɛhyɛ mmenia kyɛ betua bɛ nwo aleɛ bɔ Nyameɛ abɔ kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛle gyidie na banwu nahorɛ ne fa asennaa li ne. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Ofikyɛ nikye biala bɔ Nyameɛ abɔ ne nwo te, yeti sɛ ebie fa asennaa dɛ́ a, ɔnzɛ kyɛ okyi nikye fee, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />ofikyɛ Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne mbaeɛ yeɛ bɛfa bɛte ye nwo ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Sɛ ɛfa afutuo he ma aliemaa nemɔ a, ɛkɔyɛ Kristo Yesu somvoɛ pa, bɔ bafa edwirɛ bɔ ogyi gyidie ne ngyerɛkyerɛ pa naso batete ye, ɛhene yeɛ ali ye si pɛpɛɛpɛ ne. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Nakoso, edwirɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ bɔ otia nningyein krongron ne, bɔ gua. Ebie yeɛ ole bɔ nworowaa mɔ ka ne. Mmom fa nyamesom pa tete wɔ nwo. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Ofikyɛ, sɛ ɛtengyɛ-tengyɛ w'aporɛ nu a, mvasoɛ kaa wɔ so, nakoso mvasoɛ wɔ nyamesom pa so wɔ nikye biala nu, ofikyɛ ɔboka yɛ ɛnɛ, na ɔkɔboka yɛ wɔ ngoa bɔ ɔkɔwa kyẽa bie nanu koso. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Ɛhe te nahorɛ dwirɛ bɔ odikyɛ yedɛ yɛ to nu koraa. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ yɛyere yɛ nwo yɛyɛ adwuma serɛ ne, ofikyɛ yɛ nye la Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte ase naso. Ye yeɛ ɔte mmenia mukoraati Agyenkwa ne, ɛnga-nga bɛ bɔ bɛdi nahorɛ ne.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Kɔ so fa ahyɛdeɛ he ma bɛ, na kyirekyire bɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Nnɛmaa ebiala bu abrandeɛ bɔ ɛte ne animtia, mmom yɛ nneasoɛ pa ma bɛ bɔ bɛdi nahorɛ ne wɔ dwudwolɛ, suban, ɔdɔ, gyidie, ne ahoteɛ nu. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Fa wɔ nwo wura badwanu kengalɛ ne ngyerɛkyerɛ nu kodwu kyɛ ngɔwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Nnɛbu wɔ nye gua akyɛdeɛ bɔ ɔwɔ wɔ nu, bɔ mbanyi nemɔ nate ngɔmhyɛ so fa mane wɔ mmerɛ bɔ bɛfale bɛ sa bɛguale wɔ so naso. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Dwenedwene ɛhemɔ nwo, fa w'adwene mukoraati sie so, ná wamaa ebiala anwu ngɔsoɛ bɔ enya ye ne. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Nea wɔ nwo so yé, na ma wɔ nye hɔ wɔ ngyerɛkyerɛ nwo. Yere wɔ nwo yɛ ɛhemɔ, sɛ ɛyɛ sɔ a, ekole wɔ nwo ɔne bɛ bɔ betie wɔ ne ngoa.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Nnɛtwi panyi nyunu, mmom dwudwo kyire ye te kyɛ wɔ baba, ɛne mmrandeɛ nemɔ koso tena kyɛ eliema mmrienzua, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />mmrasua mbanyi ne koso, yɛ bɛ kyɛ wɔ maame mɔ, na ɛne ndaluwa nemɔ tena te kyɛ eliema mmrasua wɔ ahoteɛ mukoraati nu.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Akunafoɛ bɔ bɛlle bie ne, boka bɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Nakoso, sɛ kunaniɛ bie le mmaa anaa nnomaa a, ye de odikyɛ bɛdi moa bɛsua kyɛ bɛkɔla nyamesom pa ali wɔ awuro, na bɛfa bɔ ɔfata b'awofo ne bɛ nana mɔ bɛma bɛ, ɛhene yeɛ ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Na brasua kunaniɛ bɔ olle bokafoɛ biala, ná wahia ye ne, wafa ye nye wato Nyameɛ so, na daa biala ɔfa ngotosrɛ ne mbaeɛ kɔ ye nyunu eyia ne kɔngɔen. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Nakoso, kunaniɛ bɔ odi ye akɔnnɔ si ne, ɔte te-ase-awuo. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Kɔ so fa ahyɛdeɛ he ma bɛ, na ebiala annya bɛ nwo dwirɛ biala anga. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ ebie ngora nnea ye abusuafoɛ, ɛnga-nga bɛ bɔ ɔne bɛ te awuro ne a, wahwe ye nwo wafi gyidie nanwo, na ɔte nnipa-bɔneniɛ tra bɔ onne nni ne.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Sɛ ɛkɔfa kunaniɛ bie dumaa kɔboka so a, sana wali afoɛ 60 bɔ ɔkɔ ne, ebie bɔ né ohu kõ, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />na bɛdi ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ ɔyɛ nyumaa pa; ebie yeɛ ole kyɛ ɔtete mmaa, odɛ́ mmenia wɔfoɛ, onwunzi akrongronfoɛ gya bo, ɔboka bɛ bɔ bɛ nwo ahyere bɛ ne, na ofi ye ahone nu yɛ adwuma pa biala.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Nakoso, nnɛfa akunafoɛ bɔ bɛte ndaluwa ne boka so, ofikyɛ sɛ b'akɔnnɔ ye b'adwene fi Kristo so a, ɛyɛ a ne bɛpena kyɛ bɛgya, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />na bekonya atemmuo, ofikyɛ bapo gyidie bɔ bɛli moa benyane ye ne. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Afei koso, bɛbayɛ mmenia bɔ bɛnguro adwuma, na ekonwu ye ne, ne bɛnate-nate amanvoɛ awuro nu. Nná adwuma ngome yeɛ bɛnguro ɔ, mmom bɛdi nzekure, bɛfa bɛ nwo bɛdide amanvoɛ dwirɛ nu, na bɛkeka edwirɛ bɔ ye nwo nhia kyɛ bɛka ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Yeti, akunafoɛ bɔ bɛte ndaluwa ne de, mepena kyɛ bɛgya, bɛwo mmaa, na bɛnea b'awuro, na wamma ɔtamfo ne annya yɛ nwo dwirɛ biala anga. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Ofikyɛ ebiemɔ ahwe bɛ nwo baali Satan si dada. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Sɛ gyidiniɛ brasua le abusuafoɛ bɔ bɛte akunafoɛ a, maa ɔboka bɛ, ná bannyɛ adesoa bamma asafo ne. Ɛhe kɔmaa asafo ne kɔhora kɔnea akunafoɛ bɔ bɛlle bie ne.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Ɛmɔfa nidie paa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “nidie bɔ ɔbɔ ye nwo nyɔ”</char></note> bɛma mbanyi bɔ bɛdi nningyein nyunu yé ne, titire ne, bɛ bɔ bɛbɔ mmɔden wɔ dwudwolɛ ne ngyerɛkyerɛ nu ne. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Ofikyɛ tworɔnzɛm ne ka kyɛ, “Nnɛkyekye nandwie noa, mmerɛ bɔ ɔporo hwiit ne,” yeɛ “Sɛ ebie yɛ adwuma a, ye akatua fata ye.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Sɛ bɛbɔ panyi bie sommoɛ a, nnedɛ to nu, sana mmenia nyɔ anaa nza di ye nwo adanzeɛ kora. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Nakoso, bɛ bɔ bɔne ali bɛ ti ne de, ka bɛ nyunu wɔ ebiala nyunu, na wabɔ bɛ bɔ baha ne kɔkɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ngyi Nyameɛ, Yesu Kristo ne abɔfo bɔ baye bɛ namukoraati nyunu mehyɛ wɔ kyɛ, di sɔ akwankyerɛ he aso bɔ ɛngɔyɛ nyeyemuɛ, na ɛngɔnea ebiala nyunu ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Nnɛpere wɔ nwo fa wɔ sa gua ebiala so lle, ná ɛne bɛ angyɛ bɛ bɔne ne. Kɔ so bɔ bra bɔ ye nwo te ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Nnɛno nzue kõ;<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nnɛno nzue ngome kõ.”</char></note> wɔ ko ne, ɔne fokyɛlɛ bɔ ɛtaa fokyɛ nati, ɛyɛ a no nzãa kaa.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Mmenia biemɔ yɛ bɔne a, ye nwo da berɛ ma ebiala nwu ye, na ɔfa bɛ kɔ atemmuo nu, nakoso ebiemɔ deɛ de, ɔkyɛ kora ne banwu ye. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Sɔ ala koso yeɛ nyumaa pa da adi maa ebiala nwu ye, na sɛ bannwu ye ndɛ po a, ɔngɔhora nngɔfea daa.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Ngoaa koso, odikyɛ bɛkɔ so bɛfa nidie bɔ ɔfata bɛma bɛ wuramɔ, ná wamma mmenia angẽka Nyameɛ dumaa ne ye ngyerɛkyerɛ nanwo dwirɛ tɛɛ biala. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Ná ngoaa bɔ bɛ wuramɔ te gyidifoɛ ne, nnɛmaa bɛfa ye kyɛ bɛte gyidifoɛ nati, bɛbu bɛ animtia. Mmom, odikyɛ bɛyere bɛ nwo bɛsõ bɛ yé, ofikyɛ bɛbɔ benya bɛ soen pa naso mvasoɛ ne te gyidifoɛ ne aliemaa mɔ.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Adɔfo”</char></note> Kɔ so kyirekyire sɔ nningyein hemɔ, na fa ye nwo afutuo ma.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Ebiala bɔ okyirekyire ngyerɛkyerɛ foforɛ, ná onne edwirɛ pa bɔ ofi y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ anaa ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ ɔne nyamesom pa yia ne ndonu ne, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />wama ye nwo so, na ɔnde hwee bo. Na aporowaa ne edwirɛ nwo manzoin ali ye ti; na bɔ ofi nu ba yeɛ ole anyeborolɛ, mbakye-mbakye-muɛ, dumaa sɛkyelɛ, mmenia nwo adwemmɔne, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />ɔne manzoin bɔ ɔkɔ so wɔ bɛ bɔ b'adwene asɛkye na bɛnde nahorɛ ne bo kõ ne afia ne. B'adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ, bɛfa nyamesom pa bɛpena mvasoɛ.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ ebie yɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro, na ɔmaa ye nye sɔ bɔ ole ye a, mvasoɛ wɔ so paa. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Ofikyɛ yamva hwee yamma wiase, na yɛngɔfa hwee yɛngɔfi nu yɛngɔhɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Yeti, sɛ yɛle bɔ yɛkoli, ne bɔ yɛkowura a, odikyɛ yɛmaa yɛ nye sɔ ɛhene ala. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Bɛ bɔ bɛ nye aboro, ná bɛpena kyɛ bɛyɛ asikafoɛ ne, bɛtɔ nzɔhwɛ, ngaen, ɔne ngwasea akɔnnɔ pee bɔ opira sona nu; na ɛhene yeɛ ɔsɛkye bɛ koraa ne. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Na bɔne mukoraati ndii yeɛ ole sikaa anyeborolɛ. Na ɛhene yeɛ ebiemɔ ali ye si maa yeti, bahwe bɛ nwo bafi gyidie nanwo, na bafa ɔhaw pee bawa bɛ nwo so ne.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Nakoso, wɔ, Nyameɛ sona de, nwati fi ɛhemɔ nwo. Na yere wɔ nwo di tenenee, nyamesom pa, gyidie, ɔdɔ, animia, ne nningyein bɔ ɔkɔmaa ɛkɔdwo si. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Kõ gyidie koɛ pa ne; ná daa ngoa bɔ yeti bɛfrɛle wɔ, na ɛhane ye nwo dwirɛ wɔ adanzefoɛ pee nyunu ne, sɔ nu serɛ-serɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ngyi Nyameɛ bɔ ɔma nningyein mukoraati ngoa, ɔne Yesu Kristo, adanzeniɛ bɔ ogyinane Pontio Pilato nyunu lili ye adanzeɛ wɔ badwanu kama-kama ne nyunu mehyɛ wɔ kyɛ, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />di sɔ ahyɛdeɛ hemɔ so, na nnɛmaa efiɛ ne ngekayɛɛ biala ba wɔ nwo, kodwu kyɛ bɛkɔla y'Awurade Yesu Kristo ali. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Na sɛ mmerɛ ne so a, Ɛdangama komapɛ twen bɔ ole anigye ne kɔla ye ali. Ye yeɛ ɔte ahemvo nu Hene, ne awura mɔ nu Awurade ne; <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />ye ngome yeɛ onwu lle, na ɔte kanea bɔ ebiala ngora mbingye ye nu, bɔ ebiala nwuni ye lle, na ebiala ngɔhora ngonwu ye ɔ. Ye yeɛ nidie ne daa tumi te ye deɛ ɔ. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Tu bɛbɔ bɛ te asikafoɛ wɔ sɔ wiase he anu ne fo kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛma bɛ nwo so, na nnɛmaa bɛfa bɛ nye bɛto b'ahonyadeɛ bɔ ɔndena berɛ ngyɛ naso. Mmom bɛfa bɛ nye bɛto Nyameɛ, bɔ ɔmaa yɛ sa ka nningyein bɔ yɛhia maa obu so naso. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Ka kyire bɛ kyɛ bɛyɛ pa, bɛyɛ asikafoɛ wɔ nyumaa pa nu, bɛbukye bɛ sa nu, na bɛhyɛ nikye, <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />sɛ bɛyɛ sɔ a, né bɛto fapem pa besie yé bɛma kyẽabie. Ɛhe kɔmaa bɛkɔsɔ ngoa paa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ngoa deinn”</char></note> nanu yé.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timoteo, bɔ bafa bawura wɔ sa ne, bɔ ye nwo waen, twe wɔ nwo fi dwudwolɛ bɔ mvasoɛ nne so bɔ otia bɔ ɔte krongron nanwo, na twe wɔ nwo fi edwirɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye “nimdeɛ” nanwo. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Ɛhe yeɛ ebiemɔ fa hoahoa bɛ nwo, bɔ wamaa bahwe bɛ nwo bafi gyidie nanwo ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Adom ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>